{"id":"HAD-0226","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Hurayrah berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"**Im Schwarzkümmel liegt Heilung für jede Krankheit außer dem Tod.**","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 5688","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ebenfalls in Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim, Nr. 2215."}